	(text "Straps: GPIO9 = BOOT (10k pull-up on UI sheet), GPIO8 = LED_N (47k pull-up -> 1 at reset),\nGPIO25 not connected (only used if eFuse STRAP_JTAG_SEL_ENABLE is burnt - do not burn it).\nWake sources: EXT1 ANY_LOW on GPIO9/10/12 (LP IO). PROBE_EXC = GPIO11 held in sleep.\nModule VBAT pin is the 3.0-3.6 V RTC supply input -> tied to +3V3, never to the CR123A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 142.24 0)
		(effects
